{"ID":"20251117140701-9qfcg2k","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251117140701-9qfcg2k","title":"UPL9-17-e——参数的系统语义","type":"doc","updated":"20251121111804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121111659-mvk1ja6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251121111659-mvk1ja6","updated":"20251121111804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20251121111706-r691bci","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251121111706-r691bci","updated":"20251121111804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"SV_DispatchThreadID\t\t// 调度线程 ID，每个线程的全局索引（系统自动传入）\nSV_GroupThreadID\t\t// 组内线程 ID，当前线程在组内的局部索引\nSV_GroupID\t\t\t\t// 线程组 ID，当前线程组在整个 Dispatch 中的索引\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251117140701-d4bxxg2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"alias":"SV_GroupID,SV_GroupThreadID","id":"20251117140701-d4bxxg2","name":"SV_DispatchThreadID","updated":"20251120115803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入口函数参数的系统语义"}]},{"ID":"20251117141252-r9e4zph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141252-r9e4zph","updated":"20251120114438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader 的内核入口函数中参数的主要有三个系统语义："}]},{"ID":"20251117141332-761xp8c","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141332-761xp8c","updated":"20251117141342"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141332-r8h6vug","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141332-r8h6vug","updated":"20251117141336"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141332-3npueys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141332-3npueys","updated":"20251117141336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_GroupID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141332-ef25xuf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141332-ef25xuf","updated":"20251117141340"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141332-d3j9s76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141332-d3j9s76","updated":"20251117141340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_GroupThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141333-cw75zyo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141333-cw75zyo","updated":"20251117141342"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141333-oty42ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141333-oty42ze","updated":"20251117141342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_DispatchThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141252-3xdfrjf","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251117141252-3xdfrjf","updated":"20251120113916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251117141344-by46gs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141344-by46gs8","updated":"20251117141401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"语义：是 CG / HLSL 中的一种“数据标签”\n用来告诉 GPU 某个变量在渲染管线或计算管线中代表什么意义\n语义是 Shader 输入、输出变量的角色标签\n它告诉 GPU，这个变量从哪里来、要传到哪里去、它在管线中扮演什么角色"}]},{"ID":"20251120113853-q20cfg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251120113853-q20cfg5","updated":"20251120113901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240616154520-ywczbd8","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"US2S3L9——语义"}]}]},{"ID":"20251120113916-7zdpoxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251120113916-7zdpoxa","updated":"20251120114230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"例如：新创建出来 Compute Shader 中的默认入口函数的默认参数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"id"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 语义就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_DispatchThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251120113955-eqr0tr0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251120113955-eqr0tr0","updated":"20251120114204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#pragma kernel CSMain\n\n[numthreads(8,8,1)]\nvoid CSMain (uint3 id : SV_DispatchThreadID)\n{\n    Result[id.xy] = float4(id.x \u0026 id.y, (id.x \u0026 15)/15.0, (id.y \u0026 15)/15.0, 0.0);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251117141252-881llxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141252-881llxk","updated":"20251117141413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于 Compute Shader 内核入口函数中主要使用的这三个语义\n他们主要是告诉 GPU，这个变量从哪里来，其中需要存储什么样的数据\nGPU 就会通过该变量传入对应的数据"}]},{"ID":"20251120114300-ts92uif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251120114300-ts92uif","updated":"20251120114322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个入口函数可以拥有多个不同语义的参数："}]},{"ID":"20251120114323-4p0qtko","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251120114323-4p0qtko","updated":"20251120114421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"#pragma kernel CSMain\n\n[numthreads(8,8,1)]\nvoid CSMain (uint3 id : SV_DispatchThreadID, uint3 gid : SV_GroupID, uint3 gtid : SV_GroupThreadID)\n{\n    Result[id.xy] = float4(id.x \u0026 id.y, (id.x \u0026 15)/15.0, (id.y \u0026 15)/15.0, 0.0);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251117141418-7so5y2t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117141418-7so5y2t","updated":"20251120115803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个语义的区别"}]},{"ID":"20251117141445-rx388ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141445-rx388ay","updated":"20251120114242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入口函数传入的数据类型都是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"uint3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，但是可以有不同的含义"}]},{"ID":"20251117141459-3dnbepe","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141459-3dnbepe","updated":"20251120115803"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141459-ls4x6o4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141459-ls4x6o4","updated":"20251120115451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141456-h3m6urk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141456-h3m6urk","updated":"20251117141505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_GroupID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251117141501-mok2gml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141501-mok2gml","updated":"20251120115018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程组 ID，当前线程组在整个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的索引：当前是第几组，假设为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(1,2,0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251120115022-shph789","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251120115022-shph789","updated":"20251120115451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以理解为：假设处理的是一个贴图，其中包含若干块方块区域（线程组），方块区域内包含若干个格子（线程），\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_GroupID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 语义参数可以知道：当前线程位于第几个方块区域，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(1,2,0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就是方块区域在所有线程组内的坐标"}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141459-ip63vey","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141459-ip63vey","updated":"20251120115426"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141445-r7dwd0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141445-r7dwd0y","updated":"20251117141546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_GroupThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251117141544-23kpdw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141544-23kpdw4","updated":"20251117141619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组内线程 ID，当前线程在组内的局部索引：当前线程是组内第几个，假设 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(4,6,0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251120115027-aay5f3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251120115027-aay5f3l","updated":"20251120115426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以理解为：假设处理的是一个贴图，其中包含若干块方块区域（线程组），方块区域内包含若干个格子（线程），\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_GroupThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 语义参数可以知道：当前线程是当前所在方块区域里的第几个格子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(4,6,0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就是格子在当前所在方块区域内的坐标"}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141459-rbgydtx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141459-rbgydtx","updated":"20251120115803"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141445-vckdpka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141445-vckdpka","updated":"20251117141623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_DispatchThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251117141625-8up7a7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141625-8up7a7x","updated":"20251120115803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调度线程 ID，每个线程的全局索引（系统自动传入），比如第 N 个像素、第 N 个粒子\n假设一个线程组包含 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(8,8,1)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 个线程，此线程的所在的线程组坐标是  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(1,2,0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，在所在线程组内的相对坐标为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(4,6,0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n则该线程在所有线程的位置是："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"(1 * 8 + 4, 2 * 8 + 6, 0 * 1 + 0) = (12, 22, 0)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n可以理解为：唯一线程编号"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141831-69acn7q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251117141831-69acn7q","updated":"20251120115957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三个语义对我们的意义"}]},{"ID":"20251117141844-c0we8br","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141844-c0we8br","updated":"20251120115957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141846-0apfhqy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141846-0apfhqy","updated":"20251120115957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141846-7yjrogi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141846-7yjrogi","updated":"20251117141910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最常用"}]},{"ID":"20251117141912-5zymh87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141912-5zymh87","updated":"20251117141912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SV_DispatchThreadID"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251117141905-zxg781t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141905-zxg781t","updated":"20251120115957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它可以帮助我们直接映射到图像像素（2D 数据）或数组元素（1D 数据）的下标，可以让我们直接处理目标数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251117141849-5iuc56j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251117141849-5iuc56j","updated":"20251117141849"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251117141849-g1bbk80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251117141849-g1bbk80","updated":"20251117141849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常用"}]},{"ID":"20251117141851-6kp93m6","Type":